CORE
main.c
--generate-function-body reach_error --generate-function-body-options assert-false _ --witness -
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^          value: "\\\\result == 42"$
^          line: 6$
^        type: "target"$
^          line: 8$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The assertion of a generated function body is located at the function's
declaration, which is not a statement; the target of the violation witness is
the call of that function instead.
